sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch13-08> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-08--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-08--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch13-08: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.64" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.638"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.66"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Thickness and curvature are ordinary measurements on horns that are already scanned or photographed, and a phylogenetic regression is standard. The open sample can test the tendency in the better-represented bovids and is not a balanced survey of every antelope. Shared ancestry can produce the same association Thompson attributes to the room a thick cross-section gives for unequal growth, so the geometric correlation is more resolvable than that mechanical reason." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Regress a curvature or spiral-tightness measure on basal horn diameter across antelopes, goats, and sheep, with a phylogenetic control. The claim is supported by a positive thickness–curvature relationship within and across clades; no relationship, or the reverse, would refute the stated tendency." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Related species share both thick horns and strong spirals, so a naive correlation is phylogenetically confounded.", "Scanned samples under-represent slender-horned antelopes relative to sheep and goats." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch13-08--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch13-08--grok--dataset-2> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-08--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch13-08 by Grok 4.7: 0.84" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.84"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-08--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch13-08> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-08--grok--operationalizability> .
